" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><nav aria-label="breadcrumb"><ol class="breadcrumb"><li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li><li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Blog</li></ol></nav><article><h1 class="mb-4">Dolphin Premier vs Aiper Scuba S1: Filtration Power or Cordless Convenience?</h1><p class="text-muted mb-5">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><div><h2>Quick Verdict</h2><p>The <strong>Dolphin Premier</strong> is the better choice for pools with leaves, mixed debris, and demanding filtration needs.</p><p>The <strong>Aiper Scuba S1</strong> is better for buyers who want cordless convenience and easier physical handling.</p><h2>At-a-Glance Comparison</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Dolphin Premier</th><th>Aiper Scuba S1</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Design</td><td>Corded</td><td>Cordless</td></tr><tr><td>Best For</td><td>Debris-heavy pools</td><td>Convenience-first owners</td></tr><tr><td>Filtration</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Wall Cleaning</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Runtime</td><td>Continuous</td><td>Battery limited</td></tr><tr><td>Value</td><td>Excellent for debris</td><td>Excellent for convenience</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Debris Handling</h2><p>The Premier's biggest advantage is filtration flexibility. It is better suited for pools that face changing debris conditions throughout the year.</p><p>The Aiper Scuba S1 performs well for routine cleaning but is less specialized for heavy debris and mixed filtration needs.</p><h2>Convenience</h2><p>The Scuba S1 wins for convenience. No cord means faster setup and easier storage. The Premier requires cord management but provides more dependable long-cycle cleaning.</p><h2>Final Recommendation</h2><p>Choose the <strong>Dolphin Premier</strong> if debris is your main challenge. Choose the <strong>Aiper Scuba S1</strong> if cordless handling is your main priority.</p><h2>Related Resources</h2><ul><li><a href='/reviews/Dolphin-Premier'>Dolphin Premier Review</a></li><li><a href='/reviews/Aiper-Scuba-S1'>Aiper Scuba S1 Review</a></li><li><a href='/blog/robotic-pool-cleaners-for-leaves-vs-fine-debris'>Leaves vs Fine Debris</a></li><li><a href='/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners'>Corded vs Cordless</a></li></ul><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>Which is better for leaves?</h3><p>The Dolphin Premier is better for leaf-heavy pools.</p><h3>Which is more convenient?</h3><p>The Aiper Scuba S1 is more convenient because it is cordless.</p></div><div class="mt-5"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/reviews">Find Your Perfect Robot</a></div></div></div></article></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n0:\"$L3\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4:I[3728,[],\"\"]\n6:I[9928,[],\"\"]\n7:I[8326,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"308\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-23a4c3f098b125a3.js\"],\"\"]\n8:I[6954,[],\"\"]\n9:I[7264,[],\"\"]\nc:I[5826,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"308\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-23a4c3f098b125a3.js\"],\"\"]\nd:I[7625,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\ne:I[6507,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/3"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"26-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\nb:T857,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003ch2\u003eQuick Verdict\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eDolphin Premier\u003c/strong\u003e is the better choice for pool