ependable long-cycle cleaning.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFinal Recommendation\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eChoose the \u003cstrong\u003eDolphin Premier\u003c/strong\u003e if debris is your main challenge. Choose the \u003cstrong\u003eAiper Scuba S1\u003c/strong\u003e if cordless handling is your main priority.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRelated Resources\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/reviews/Dolphin-Premier'\u003eDolphin Premier Review\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/reviews/Aiper-Scuba-S1'\u003eAiper Scuba S1 Review\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/blog/robotic-pool-cleaners-for-leaves-vs-fine-debris'\u003eLeaves vs Fine Debris\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners'\u003eCorded vs Cordless\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFrequently Asked Questions\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhich is better for leaves?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Dolphin Premier is better for leaf-heavy pools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhich is more convenient?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Aiper Scuba S1 is more convenient because it is cordless.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3:[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"1\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"buildId\":\"ibMnxLVRNd6eQkSmhgFst\",\"assetPrefix\":\"\",\"initialCanonicalUrl\":\"/blog/dolphin-premier-vs-aiper-scuba-s1\",\"initialTree\":[\"\",{\"children\":[\"blog\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"dolphin-premier-vs-aiper-scuba-s1\",\"d\"],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__?{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"dolphin-premier-vs-aiper-scuba-s1\\\"}\",{}]}]}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],\"initialHead\":[false,\"$L5\"],\"globalErrorComponent